- What leverage does the former business partner have (cash, assets, counterclaims, credibility, witnesses)?  
- How likely is the other side to settle if we demonstrate readiness for trial? Have they indicated any flexibility?  
- Are there potential third parties (customers, banks, co-workers) whose testimony or documents could affect the case?

