"Robert — discovery is done and I’d like a 30–45 minute strategy call to discuss whether to accept a settlement or proceed to trial. Can we review your assessment of our chance of success, estimated damages and trial costs, potential settlement range, mediation options, and collection/enforcement concerns? I’ll bring the discovery materials, contract, and a witness list. Please let me know your available times this week. Thanks."

