- Witness contact info and short statements or notes on what each witness can attest to.
- Documentation of any offers, communications about settlement, and anything relevant to bad faith.

4) Settlement terms and deal points to negotiate
Monetary
- Total amount; lump sum vs installment payments.
- Interest for delayed payments and late-payment penalties.
- Security: promissory note, UCC‑1 filing, lien on assets, escrow, or personal guaranty.

