- Full mutual release and scope (specific vs. general)
- Confidentiality / non-disparagement clauses
- Payment schedule and remedies for default (interest, acceleration, security)
- Allocation for taxable character (e.g., damages vs. interest vs. fees) — ask a tax advisor
- Who pays costs/attorney fees
- No admission of liability clause
- Enforcement mechanism (escrow, certified funds, secured note)
- Draft/approve release and settlement language BEFORE agreeing orally

