  - What non‑monetary outcomes might be negotiated (reinstatement, confidentiality, future business restrictions)?
  - What are the tax implications of a potential settlement (lump sum vs lost wages vs punitive – ask a tax advisor if needed)?
  - How involved will I need to be at trial (testimony, availability, travel)?

