- What settlement range would you recommend (low/medium/high) and why?
- If the settlement includes installments, how do we protect against non-payment (security, escrow, lien, confession of judgment where applicable)?

Discovery and evidentiary readiness
- Do we have all the documents and witnesses needed to prove the case? If not, what’s missing?
- Are any key witnesses hostile, unavailable, or subject to impeachment?
- Any outstanding discovery disputes or motions that materially affect strength of case?

