- Time cost: months/years to resolution vs. how soon you’d get settlement funds
- Certainty: guaranteed cash now vs. uncertain future result
- Collectibility: can the opposing party actually pay a judgment?
- Non-monetary priorities: reputation, confidentiality, future business relationships
- Enforcement costs: if you win, how much to enforce/collect?
- Emotional/opportunity cost: stress and time spent vs. closing this chapter
- Minimum acceptable settlement (your walk-away number) — set this now, and share it with your lawyer if you’re comfortable

