4. A recommended target settlement and a walk‑away (bottom) number, plus what protections (escrow/security, release scope, confidentiality) you would insist on.
5. Whether mediation is advisable now and your view of the opposing party’s ability to pay/enforceability risks.
6. Projected attorney fees for trial vs negotiation/mediation.

