- Whether the settlement is an admission of liability (avoid if possible)
- Non-compete or non-solicit language (watch for overly broad restrictions)
- Timeline for performance and remedies for breach of settlement
- Government/third-party reporting (tax implications)
- Public filing / sealing (if you want to keep it private)
- Allocation of payment to principal/interest/fees (tax consequences)

