- Will a settlement include a confidentiality clause that could affect future business or public record?
- Will settlement or trial affect any professional licenses, contracts, or reputational issues?
- Are there precedent or legal principle issues you'd want decided on the record (i.e., do you want to set a precedent even if recovery is similar)?

